<div>
    <p>Dear {{data.tlName}},</p>

    <p>The TQ reply has been submitted for {{data.tender_name}} ({{data.tender_no}}).</p>

    {{#if data.replied_document_url}}
        <p>TQ Reply Document: <a href="{{data.replied_document_url}}" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: underline;">{{data.replied_document_name}}</a></p>
    {{/if}}

    {{#if data.proof_of_submission_url}}
        <p>Proof of TQ Submission: <a href="{{data.proof_of_submission_url}}" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: underline;">{{data.proof_of_submission_name}}</a></p>
    {{/if}}

    <p>The Tender due date and time was {{data.dueDate}}.</p>
    <p>The TQ reply date and time was {{data.tqSubmissionDate}}.</p>
    <p>We submitted the TQ {{data.timeBeforeDeadline}} before the bid submission deadline.</p>

    <p>"We leverage our team work to create results."</p>

    <p>Best Regards,<br />{{data.teName}}</p>
</div>
